<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Full combat loadouts for the player's wing in the trials. SWI has no named loadout for these
     ships, and a <level> loadout on a player-owned ship gets no engines (the player faction owns no
     SWI equipment). Slots, tags and equipment from research/trials-ships.md section 1: engines are
     the ship's own; weapons, turrets and shields were picked by matching slot tags and are optional,
     so a slot that doesn't take one is left empty instead of failing. Missile launchers are
     filled too (2026-11-10, after a run showed the R-41's two HM-6 slots empty), with as many
     missiles as the ship stores. -->
